            "action_name": {
              "value": "Change Shape"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate, divine, polymorph)\n\nThe aso berang takes the appearance of any Medium or Small humanoid creature. In this form, the aso berang can't use their tusk Strikes, and their claw Strike becomes a fist Strike that deals bludgeoning damage and loses the reach trait."
